      "content": "When the weight feels this constant, it's understandable to feel trapped and like you've failed at everything. It sounds like the source of the pressure isn't just one thing, but a compounding loop of external and internal expectations. Instead of trying to solve the entire trap at once, could we focus on one tiny boundary or one small thing you can let go of today, even if it's just a thought?",
      "source": "target",
